{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/418321-a-really-weird-durance","id":418321,"title":"A really weird Durance","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-02-24T20:58:05-08:00","id":418321,"title":"A really weird Durance","content":"A more than usually out there Keeper decides to create a Realm based on Bubble Witch Saga, and starts tossing pretty girls, let's say, mid teens to early twenties, into it. The setup is fairly simple: each game level corresponds to a section of the Realm, each section has an exit that opens when the animals are freed or the last row is cleared, or whatever, with the last section, once cleared, opening onto a Trod back to Earth. The girls have Token bubble-wands to pass the gates, and maybe broomsticks. Black cats are optional <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />. After 430 levels of this (that's the most recent level count), what sorts of changelings might come out the other end? What Contracts might they have? Assuming they can keep them and that they're not just sticks and straws on Earth, to what use could they put their wands and brooms?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-25T00:25:52-08:00","id":418482,"title":"","content":"Seeming-wise, I'd think Wizened as most likely, with some Darklings and Fairest (this sounds very much a Wizened-style Durance; Darkling or Fairest may come in if they're modified to play up either the Cute or the Witch part).<br /> <br /> Kiths:<br /> Gameplayer variant (from Winter Masques), emphasising computer games rather than board games.<br /> Cleareyes variant, representing enhanced senses and pattern-matching.<br /> Witchtooth variant (again from WM) if they really got into the role.<br /> Soldier variant focusing on ranged weaponry rather than blades.<br /> <br /> Contract-wise, Contracts of Hearth are a fair bet, but nothing else springs to mind.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-25T06:45:44-08:00","id":418655,"title":"","content":"All good thoughts. Anything concerning the wands and brooms? Should they work on Earth, and if they do, of what use would they be? Sure, flying is useful, but shooting bubbles?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-25T07:26:41-08:00","id":418698,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LadyLens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/418321-a-really-weird-durance?p=418655#post418655\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">All good thoughts. Anything concerning the wands and brooms? Should they work on Earth, and if they do, of what use would they be? Sure, flying is useful, but shooting bubbles?</div> </div> </div> </div>Could be useful as a distraction, particularly if they're large bubbles - that is, causing a penalty to an attacker's Inititative.<br /> <br /> Flying... I think basically it's too public for changeling magic. That said, borrowing from the winged kiths, a broom could reduce falling damage. Or maybe serve as a speed enhancer.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-25T09:55:19-08:00","id":418845,"title":"","content":"Kith: Tellurian.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3855-gebbethine","name":"gebbethine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3855_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"233"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-25T12:13:03-08:00","id":419124,"title":"","content":"Too public? Changeling magic is many things, but &quot;discreet&quot; is nowhere on the list. It's generally quite blatant.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key"